Qwork is an independent derivative application. Its TypeScript orchestration,
desktop interface, IPC, storage and Windows packaging were newly implemented.
Retained Meldwork CLI and Agent installer modules remain attributed to their original authors.
The installer integration retains pinned npm recipes and integrity checks;
Qwork limits its catalog to supported Agents and omits the skill browser.
